Z||000061||Voytek||02-07-2001||03:24 PM||||To Mr.MR2 AND FIERO OWNER:<BR>While I respect some import cars, I think you started out on the wrong foot.  I would suggest some research and experience before making any negative comments about the Fiero on the FIERO FORUM.  It's like putting a stick in an ant farm.  It is true that some supercharged MR2's are pretty fast but it is tough to compare them today because #1: engines are used up, or #2: they are not as stock as they used to be.  The fact remains that the Fiero has more torque than the MR2 - very important off the line - and the MR2 (only the supercharged) has more HP to weight - important when you're revving the crap out  of your engine.  I have raced a normally aspirated MR2 in my 4-cyl '85 Fiero and by the time we got it to 50 MPH I was about 1/2 car lenght ahead.  This doen't prove anything!  As far as handling goes - Oreif is right - I have the issue of Car and Driver from 1988 and the Fiero outhandles both, the MR2 AND the CRX.<P>To Neverfinished:<BR>I think you have confused import-bashing with racism.  I haven't see anyone on this forum to-date putting down any skin color.  Bashing imports does not constitute racism.  Also, the word Ricer hasn't offended anyone yet.  As far as Japanese cars go - true, there are some really good ones.  However, American vehicles received bad rep during the 80's for cars such as Phoenix / Omega / K-car and others (and rightfully so).  The Fiero was an innovative exception.  Since those years the line of quality between the imports and domestics has been blurred.  While I prefer domestic (and the Fiero above all!) anyone is entitled to their opinion.<BR>Voytek||||reg||10
Z||000062||wkayl||02-07-2001||03:28 PM||||Well said.||||reg||1
Z||000063||Voytek||02-07-2001||03:45 PM||||Johny K<BR>I figured you were from Canada.  Where else in the world are people brainwashed to look for racism in EVERY PHRASE OR WORD THEY HEAR??!!  Lighten up.  I've been called a Polack numerous times and I don't take offence to it.  I suppose you'd tell me I should if my skin color was different and I drove a foreign car?  FREEDOM OF SPEECH MAN!! Otherwise move to China!||||reg||1
