Z||000082||Oreif||02-08-2001||11:33 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MR2 and FIERO owner:<BR><B>WELL DAMM THATS THE TRUTH A SUPERCHARGED MR2 CAN GET DOWN WITH ALLMOST ANY CAR ON THE ROAD TODAY. <I> "I REMEMBER LAST SUMMER I KILLED A VIPER ON THE FREEWAY.DOING 154MPH." </I> BUT I NEVER RACE OTHER MR2S OF FIEROS.BECAUSE I RESPECT THEM.BUT IF A FIERO EVER WANT TO RUMBLE WE CAN GO&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;<BR>                   <BR>                &gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;&gt;</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>First, In order to claim a "kill" the other car <B> has to be racing! </B> There is no way a supercharged MR2 could even get near a viper. First, The viper has a weight to horsepower ratio of 8 pounds per horsepower, (at it's advertised HP rating which many have questioned it's accuracy as being way low!) an MR2 with supercharger is 20 pounds per horsepower. Second, the first gen MR2's were not capable of 154mph. The aerodynamics of the body prevented anything over 130mph.  Finally, a Viper goes from 0 to 100 in less time than any MR2 does from 0 to 60. The viper is a street legal race car basically. If a supercharged MR2 was that fast, don't you think the car magazines would have compared the MR2 to a corvette, F-body, mustang, RX-7 twin turbo, NSX, Porsche 911T, or a 300ZX twin turbo, Instead of a normally aspirated V-6 Fiero? Also I read thru your previous posts, For someone who doesn't even have an MR2 or a Fiero you talk big. What happened to your MR2? Did you beat it into the ground? Even if your MR2 was as fast as you claim, why did you get rid of it? It would have been cheaper to rebuild it.<BR>Your only purpose here is to start s**t. (which looks like you've done) Why don't you go to another forum and cause trouble. Hell if you had an MR2 that beat out a viper why don't you go to a viper forum and rag on them?<BR>I'll bet you have never even owned an MR2. You probably use to drive a 4-door yugo and "raced" kids on 10-speed bicycles! (well at least you won some of those races) <BR>Just pack up your B.S. and get outta here.<P><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 02-08-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000083||Oreif||02-08-2001||11:42 AM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by MR2 and FIERO owner:<BR><B>****ING HOE A MR2 CAN KILL YOUR PUSSY ASS FIERO.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Gee for someone who doesn't even have one..........<P>Dilberts rule # 12.<BR>"Never argue with an Idiot, They drag you down to their level and beat you with experience"<P>I think it is time for us (The Fiero Forum)<BR>To ignore this little ________ (fill in your own word) and cease posting to this thread.<P>Maybe Cliff should lock it now.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Oreif (edited 02-08-2001).]||||reg||1
